{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A game about care, community and change</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Selan\u00eca </i>is a narrative game about care, community, and change. You will play the role of the Rewriter, a confidant who will help other characters to look at their own stories in a different light, in order to overcome a moment of stalemate in their lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946540/extras/badbe660ee1a85ddd58590feb883e0f5.poster.avif?t=1756216052\" width=616 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946540/extras/badbe660ee1a85ddd58590feb883e0f5.webm?t=1756216052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946540/extras/badbe660ee1a85ddd58590feb883e0f5.mp4?t=1756216052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character you\u2019ll meet has their own unique experience to share. Choose from the wide range of dialogue options at your disposal to express your point of view and resonate with the other characters, revealing them a new name. If you\u2019re feeling lost, don\u2019t worry: Mentor, Froggy and other unusual creatures will be here to help you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946540/extras/bf4f954aec16b9e3dd7d02e8c6a751cf.poster.avif?t=1756216052\" width=616 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946540/extras/bf4f954aec16b9e3dd7d02e8c6a751cf.webm?t=1756216052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946540/extras/bf4f954aec16b9e3dd7d02e8c6a751cf.mp4?t=1756216052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Come and rest for a while.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The role of the Rewriter is not a job, but one of the many possibilities. In <i>Selan\u00eca</i>, every place offers the opportunity to relax and do different things. Take the greenhouse, for example: here you can let yourself be carried away by its inspirations to grow unusual plants, full of answers and even more questions. Or the kitchen, where you can cook alchemical dishes with the other characters to satisfy a hungry oven. Even more places will be added as the game is developed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946540/extras/d865787f604d9c97b02c9ca39954d10d.poster.avif?t=1756216052\" width=616 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946540/extras/d865787f604d9c97b02c9ca39954d10d.webm?t=1756216052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946540/extras/d865787f604d9c97b02c9ca39954d10d.mp4?t=1756216052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And lastly, there's the library. Here you'll find stories, poems, and diary entries written by dozens of different people who've decided to share a part of themselves and their imagination to keep you company, comfort you, and maybe even help you rethink some aspect of your life. Here, as in the rest of the game, the trigger warning system will help you choose what to read or not to read each time, so you can enjoy this world on your own terms. So grab a cup of hot chocolate, a soft blanket, and let yourself be carried away under the moonlight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946540/extras/2bcd3fc190ee46e8b116e17fd3377cea.poster.avif?t=1756216052\" width=616 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946540/extras/2bcd3fc190ee46e8b116e17fd3377cea.webm?t=1756216052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946540/extras/2bcd3fc190ee46e8b116e17fd3377cea.mp4?t=1756216052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>All cozy and zero rush.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Selan\u00eca</i> is a game without clocks, deadlines, or punishments. You will make hundreds of different choices, generating dozens of endings. But no outcome will be right or wrong. It will just be a piece of your story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946540/extras/8486cd17e7e29427b5e14268047eaf67.poster.avif?t=1756216052\" width=616 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946540/extras/8486cd17e7e29427b5e14268047eaf67.webm?t=1756216052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946540/extras/8486cd17e7e29427b5e14268047eaf67.mp4?t=1756216052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3946540?t=1756216052","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946540/622fe5ca5a75c78657c0cf01ad50138f71543295/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756216052","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946540/a9a5df0aae09eba4ecbfd7ab8136ea6e8d684acc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756216052","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946540/a9a5df0aae09eba4ecbfd7ab8136ea6e8d684acc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756216052","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A game about care, community and change</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Selan\u00eca </i>is a narrative game about care, community, and change. You will play the role of the Rewriter, a confidant who will help other characters to look at their own stories in a different light, in order to overcome a moment of stalemate in their lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946540/extras/badbe660ee1a85ddd58590feb883e0f5.poster.avif?t=1756216052\" width=616 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946540/extras/badbe660ee1a85ddd58590feb883e0f5.webm?t=1756216052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946540/extras/badbe660ee1a85ddd58590feb883e0f5.mp4?t=1756216052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character you\u2019ll meet has their own unique experience to share. Choose from the wide range of dialogue options at your disposal to express your point of view and resonate with the other characters, revealing them a new name. If you\u2019re feeling lost, don\u2019t worry: Mentor, Froggy and other unusual creatures will be here to help you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946540/extras/bf4f954aec16b9e3dd7d02e8c6a751cf.poster.avif?t=1756216052\" width=616 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946540/extras/bf4f954aec16b9e3dd7d02e8c6a751cf.webm?t=1756216052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946540/extras/bf4f954aec16b9e3dd7d02e8c6a751cf.mp4?t=1756216052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Come and rest for a while.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The role of the Rewriter is not a job, but one of the many possibilities. In <i>Selan\u00eca</i>, every place offers the opportunity to relax and do different things. Take the greenhouse, for example: here you can let yourself be carried away by its inspirations to grow unusual plants, full of answers and even more questions. Or the kitchen, where you can cook alchemical dishes with the other characters to satisfy a hungry oven. Even more places will be added as the game is developed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946540/extras/d865787f604d9c97b02c9ca39954d10d.poster.avif?t=1756216052\" width=616 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946540/extras/d865787f604d9c97b02c9ca39954d10d.webm?t=1756216052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946540/extras/d865787f604d9c97b02c9ca39954d10d.mp4?t=1756216052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And lastly, there's the library. Here you'll find stories, poems, and diary entries written by dozens of different people who've decided to share a part of themselves and their imagination to keep you company, comfort you, and maybe even help you rethink some aspect of your life. Here, as in the rest of the game, the trigger warning system will help you choose what to read or not to read each time, so you can enjoy this world on your own terms. So grab a cup of hot chocolate, a soft blanket, and let yourself be carried away under the moonlight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946540/extras/2bcd3fc190ee46e8b116e17fd3377cea.poster.avif?t=1756216052\" width=616 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946540/extras/2bcd3fc190ee46e8b116e17fd3377cea.webm?t=1756216052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946540/extras/2bcd3fc190ee46e8b116e17fd3377cea.mp4?t=1756216052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>All cozy and zero rush.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Selan\u00eca</i> is a game without clocks, deadlines, or punishments. You will make hundreds of different choices, generating dozens of endings. But no outcome will be right or wrong. It will just be a piece of your story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946540/extras/8486cd17e7e29427b5e14268047eaf67.poster.avif?t=1756216052\" width=616 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946540/extras/8486cd17e7e29427b5e14268047eaf67.webm?t=1756216052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946540/extras/8486cd17e7e29427b5e14268047eaf67.mp4?t=1756216052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["owof games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946540/c8880a714d514e28116102516ce7df23bab63613/header.jpg?t=1756216052","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Anything recent<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  2.6 Ghz Quad Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OS X<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  2.6 Ghz Quad Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3946540/1789697153/b4905ea85bb806514dc0678e0889cbeda62a48cc/1755514751/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756216051","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3946540/1789697153/b4905ea85bb806514dc0678e0889cbeda62a48cc/1755514751/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756216051","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3946540/1789697153/b4905ea85bb806514dc0678e0889cbeda62a48cc/1755514751/hls_264_master.m3u8?